---

<section class="py-24 bg-background border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div class="animate-fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 text-foreground">
        Better than ordinary calculators
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        We examined the most popular nutrition tools and designed Food Nutrition Calculator to fix the biggest frustrations. No clutter, no hidden fees, just clear data.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-left">
      
      <!-- Point 1 -->
      <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl border border-border shadow-sm hover-lift animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Cleaner Interface</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">A premium, distraction-free environment without aggressive ads or cluttered sidebars.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Point 2 -->
      <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl border border-border shadow-sm hover-lift animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">No Login Required</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Start calculating immediately. No mandatory accounts or paywalls just to see basic macros.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Point 3 -->
      <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl border border-border shadow-sm hover-lift animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Source Transparency</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Unlike others that hide where data comes from, we clearly label USDA vs local fallback data.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Point 4 -->
      <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded-xl border border-border shadow-sm hover-lift animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 400ms;">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Premium Mobile UI</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">A fluid, app-like experience on your phone, making it easy to log foods right from the kitchen.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
